{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日になりましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7thシングルバレッタ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後のイベントのお茶会がありました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった方ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張して最初にお茶を配るのを忘れました_(:3」∠)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はははっ！\nすみません〜(^^;;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きたかったな〜という方また次の機会によろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして川後P\nお誕生日おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気けっこう語るよね〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ\nひなちゃんと話してると本当に楽しいしなるほどな〜って思うこともしばしば！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ若いひなちゃん。\nこれからも未知の魅力を出し続けて行ってねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西川七海ちゃんの卒業。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/03/23/7611827/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一年間乃木坂46として活動してきて、いろいろ思うこともあったと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直。\n欠けるというのはすごくさみしい事。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも夢のために自分で決断したのならそれは背中を押してあげなければいけないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}